(V)--a name for the Ganges;
1: M. १०२. 6.
a stream of the गन्गा, flows east through the countries of Tomara, Hamsa- मार्ग, Haihaya, कर्णप्रावरण, अश्वमुख, शिकता- parvatamaru, विद्याधर, and नागमण्डल and reaches the salt ocean;
2: Br. II. १८. ४०, ५८-61; वा. ४७. ३८ and ५६.
one of the seven streams, and one of the three going towards the western direction.
3: M. १२१. ४०.
